{
  "what": "The deleted occurrences a series keeps when \"this and all following\" writes it from the cut on: cal_core::tail_exceptions, row by row. Read by the core's own test, by the phone's door test in cal-ffi, and by the TypeScript contract test through the WebAssembly door.",
